{"at":"2026-10-07T04:14:12.164Z","component":"Account Hub protocol controls","evidence":["0a3278c4735265634c3c4d96acbfe1671892565cb3a176123c65d8ac620ee5dd","5fb90de26a04c86782c454a797ab68fa4ea7c16eb753c5a1cfd5e0d6bdf72483","98c70d0fee39642306ed1a2c42db3404a254d9037df71dd3f6c7b28aaa8d15bd"],"id":"e77cd554757e01c0481924e4f97e2f7350c92e8cc7ae41a98fa0ec8367486dd6","kind":"lesson","paths":["mail/components/accountcreation/templates/accountHubEmailConfigFoundTemplate.inc.xhtml"],"quotes":[{"id":"5fb90de26a04c86782c454a797ab68fa4ea7c16eb753c5a1cfd5e0d6bdf72483","text":"          <fieldset class=\"form-options\">\n            <label id=\"imap\" class=\"config-option\">\n              <div class=\"config-title\">\n                <input type=\"radio\" name=\"config-type\" value=\"imap\" />\n                <span class=\"config-title-text\">IMAP</span>\n                <span class=\"badge\" data-l10n-id=\"account-hub-result-recommended-label\"></span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"config-text\" data-l10n-id=\"account-hub-result-imap-description\"></div>\n            </label>\n\n            <label id=\"pop3\" class=\"config-option\">\n              <div class=\"config-title\">\n                <input type=\"radio\" name=\"config-type\" value=\"pop3\" />\n                <span class=\"config-title-text\">POP3</span>\n                <span\n                  class=\"badge\"\n                  role=\"presentation\"\n                  data-l10n-id=\"account-hub-result-recommended-label\"\n                ></span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"config-text\" data-l10n-id=\"account-hub-result-pop-description\"></div>\n            </label>"}],"repository":"thunderbird","source":{"basis":"Quoted evidence supports the claim; its interpretation still needs current-source checks.","revision":"0b93f0f7a926ed94c8a0646f18b6734ec7cc0f6d","sourceAt":"2026-10-05T22:44:59Z","type":"extraction"},"status":"supported","supersedes":[],"text":"The Account Hub protocol template places native radio inputs with the same config-type name inside labeled option cards and a fieldset. IMAP and POP3 therefore share one selection group in the markup. For this choice surface, preserve the native controls and label relationship while styling the cards. The markup is useful evidence, but it does not prove keyboard, announcement, group-name or focus behavior. Those runtime accessibility checks and the review discussion remain pending.","title":"Protocol choices use native grouped radios and their containing labels","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
